[INFO] [STEP 008] 95% CI: [4.42e-03, 1.47e-02]
[INFO] [STEP 008] 
[INFO] [STEP 008] Interpretation:
[INFO] [STEP 008]   The 95% confidence interval spans a factor of 3.32,
